(7268256, 1131034, 60173, '<td valign="top">I always clean objects like this before shooting them unless for some reason, the point was that it was dirty. Most of us have our own filth to look at, we don''t want to look at yours too. We want to still be able to tell ourselves that we''re the only slobs out there, and everyone else has perfectly clean keyboards and monitors. This is just too "real" for me.  :)</td>', 'I always clean objects like this before shooting them unless for some reason, the point was that it was dirty. Most of us have our own filth to look at, we don''t want to look at yours too. We want to still be able to tell ourselves that we''re the only slobs out there, and everyone else has perfectly clean keyboards and monitors. This is just too "real" for me.  :)', '2014-10-01 13:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
