(7268617, 1131111, 159995, '<td valign="top">Funny dog!7</td>', 'Funny dog!7', '2014-10-02 13:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7268618, 1131092, 159995, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot!</td>', 'Wonderful shot!', '2014-10-02 13:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7268619, 1130665, 159995, '<td valign="top">Amazing composition, keep it up!</td>', 'Amazing composition, keep it up!', '2014-10-02 13:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7268620, 1131046, 159995, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot Max, keep it up!</td>', 'Wonderful shot Max, keep it up!', '2014-10-02 14:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7268621, 1131181, 159200, '<td valign="top">Over-edited? Lovely idea though</td>', 'Over-edited? Lovely idea though', '2014-10-02 14:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7268622, 1130757, 159200, '<td valign="top">Awesome, one of my favourites</td>', 'Awesome, one of my favourites', '2014-10-02 14:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7268629, 1131158, 30364, '<td valign="top">Nicely judged.  Tones, composition, balance; everything really.  It''s a photograph about photography, but I''ll forgive you for that because it''s pretty good anyway.  In my 7+ short list.  Thank you.</td>', 'Nicely judged.  Tones, composition, balance; everything really.  It''s a photograph about photography, but I''ll forgive you for that because it''s pretty good anyway.  In my 7+ short list.  Thank you.', '2014-10-02 15:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7268632, 1131178, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is pretty blunt and pretty delicate at the same time.  Which is how cellphone photographs can sometimes capture and convey a broader emotional range than regular, ''proper'' cameras (which can very often be too smart for their own good).  This photograph is a nice example of elegant negligence.  In my 7+ picks.  Thank you.</td>', 'This is pretty blunt and pretty delicate at the same time.  Which is how cellphone photographs can sometimes capture and convey a broader emotional range than regular, ''proper'' cameras (which can very often be too smart for their own good).  This photograph is a nice example of elegant negligence.  In my 7+ picks.  Thank you.', '2014-10-02 15:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7268634, 1130752, 30364, '<td valign="top">The graphic blocks of this picture are interesting.  Tones, shapes and proportions are all very nice, very <i>collected</i>.  It gives the photograph two identities: one the literal subject, and the other with a more emotional feel.  In fact it seems like a reverse abstract, where a realistic representation can, with a bit of imagination, be resolved backwards into a figurative one.  You probably didn''t mean any such thing, but I don''t care at all about that.  It''s in my 7+ selections whether you like it or not.  Thank you.</td>', 'The graphic blocks of this picture are interesting.  Tones, shapes and proportions are all very nice, very collected.  It gives the photograph two identities: one the literal subject, and the other with a more emotional feel.  In fact it seems like a reverse abstract, where a realistic representation can, with a bit of imagination, be resolved backwards into a figurative one.  You probably didn''t mean any such thing, but I don''t care at all about that.  It''s in my 7+ selections whether you like it or not.  Thank you.', '2014-10-02 16:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7268636, 1131172, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is the kind of photograph with which cellphones are changing the world.  It''s being there.  Although this does look like you being there just a bit late.  Still, it''s good to see someone go for the documentary shot.  It makes it a cell phone photo that''s actually <i>about</i> cell phone photos as much as it is about events in Hong Kong.  7 and thank you.</td>', 'This is the kind of photograph with which cellphones are changing the world.  It''s being there.  Although this does look like you being there just a bit late.  Still, it''s good to see someone go for the documentary shot.  It makes it a cell phone photo that''s actually about cell phone photos as much as it is about events in Hong Kong.  7 and thank you.', '2014-10-02 16:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7268637, 1130905, 30364, '<td valign="top">I wondered what the best example of photography in the challenge might look like.  And this is it.  Pointless picture beyond that demonstration (I like photographs, but I can rarely care much for photography), but this really is beautifully executed.  In my 7+ picks.  Thank you.</td>', 'I wondered what the best example of photography in the challenge might look like.  And this is it.  Pointless picture beyond that demonstration (I like photographs, but I can rarely care much for photography), but this really is beautifully executed.  In my 7+ picks.  Thank you.', '2014-10-02 16:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7268638, 1130906, 30364, '<td valign="top">Beautifully composed photograph presents an unfamiliar point of view to great effect; it actually makes the Kite look like a kite.  7 and thank you.</td>', 'Beautifully composed photograph presents an unfamiliar point of view to great effect; it actually makes the Kite look like a kite.  7 and thank you.', '2014-10-02 16:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7268641, 1130984, 30364, '<td valign="top">Best water drop photograph for ages!  Such a good idea to use the cell phone to do a low-fi version of this familiar banality.  And it''s far more interesting and has way more energy than the dreadful exemplars of which it is a wicked parody.   8 for you, and thank you.</td>', 'Best water drop photograph for ages!  Such a good idea to use the cell phone to do a low-fi version of this familiar banality.  And it''s far more interesting and has way more energy than the dreadful exemplars of which it is a wicked parody.   8 for you, and thank you.', '2014-10-02 16:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7268644, 1130644, 30364, '<td valign="top">I like this because it''s so witty (in part via the title), and because it''s such an original photograph, so perfectly composed and cropped to suit that whimsical reference.  I also like the l<i>ightness</i> of the rendering, where strength and assurance comes from apparent weakness and understatement: very Japanese!  So it''s the Order of the Thumb for you, and a thank you for the fascinating photograph.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=800078" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg"/></a></td>', 'I like this because it''s so witty (in part via the title), and because it''s such an original photograph, so perfectly composed and cropped to suit that whimsical reference.  I also like the lightness of the rendering, where strength and assurance comes from apparent weakness and understatement: very Japanese!  So it''s the Order of the Thumb for you, and a thank you for the fascinating photograph.', '2014-10-02 16:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7268651, 1131111, 30364, '<td valign="top">My favourite photograph in the challenge.  I think it''s a photograph that can only be taken with a cell phone camera.  I know that''s not literally true; any clever manipulator could make a ''real'' photograph look nearly this good in post, but this one just has the honesty of the real thing.  It''s a question of attitude, and your photograph has it.  Plus it''s a terrific composition and a very good, simple idea about the incidental relationship of one thing with another.  Nice dog, too.  Please give him (her?) this Order of the Thumb, and a biscuit.  Thank you.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=800078" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg"/></a></td>', 'My favourite photograph in the challenge.  I think it''s a photograph that can only be taken with a cell phone camera.  I know that''s not literally true; any clever manipulator could make a ''real'' photograph look nearly this good in post, but this one just has the honesty of the real thing.  It''s a question of attitude, and your photograph has it.  Plus it''s a terrific composition and a very good, simple idea about the incidental relationship of one thing with another.  Nice dog, too.  Please give him (her?) this Order of the Thumb, and a biscuit.  Thank you.', '2014-10-02 16:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
