(7269300, 1131001, 124982, '<td valign="top">What happens in Key West should stay in Key West :)</td>', 'What happens in Key West should stay in Key West :)', '2014-10-04 14:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269632, 1131152, 100393, '<td valign="top">Magnificent. 10 from me.</td>', 'Magnificent. 10 from me.', '2014-10-05 11:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269633, 1130752, 100393, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous image. 10.</td>', 'Gorgeous image. 10.', '2014-10-05 11:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269634, 1131010, 100393, '<td valign="top">Amazing Image - the processing choices are so well made. 10.</td>', 'Amazing Image - the processing choices are so well made. 10.', '2014-10-05 11:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269635, 1130906, 100393, '<td valign="top">Stunning composition, stunning contrast. 10</td>', 'Stunning composition, stunning contrast. 10', '2014-10-05 11:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269660, 1131105, 124982, '<td valign="top">Simply exquisite color and detail!</td>', 'Simply exquisite color and detail!', '2014-10-05 12:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269964, 1130726, 13077, '<td valign="top">Excellent light, and a beautiful scene with very good composition.</td>', 'Excellent light, and a beautiful scene with very good composition.', '2014-10-06 00:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269966, 1131101, 13077, '<td valign="top">Interesting that you''ve done a black and white photo of verdant things, but it does work well. Very dark, seems to show the ominous side of an idyllic, colorful green world.</td>', 'Interesting that you''ve done a black and white photo of verdant things, but it does work well. Very dark, seems to show the ominous side of an idyllic, colorful green world.', '2014-10-06 00:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269969, 1130914, 13077, '<td valign="top">Excellent job - I think the very deep DOF in this case helped, some might feel the background is too busy but I think it adds substance and another layer to this two-dimensional, though beautiful, spiderweb.<br/>The only critique I have is that the horizon seems to be crooked, although it looks like you squared up with the center of  the web and since that is the subject it almost echoes the feeling of the land beyond being another dimension.</td>', 'Excellent job - I think the very deep DOF in this case helped, some might feel the background is too busy but I think it adds substance and another layer to this two-dimensional, though beautiful, spiderweb.The only critique I have is that the horizon seems to be crooked, although it looks like you squared up with the center of  the web and since that is the subject it almost echoes the feeling of the land beyond being another dimension.', '2014-10-06 00:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269975, 1130693, 13077, '<td valign="top">Oh snap! lol<br/>I would have suggested cropping to remove the bit of shore or whatever that is at the bottom left corner there. All it adds to this photo is a distraction.</td>', 'Oh snap! lolI would have suggested cropping to remove the bit of shore or whatever that is at the bottom left corner there. All it adds to this photo is a distraction.', '2014-10-06 00:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269979, 1131037, 13077, '<td valign="top">Ready... Aim... Fire!<br/>BOOOOM!! ...no, wait... cha-CHIK!</td>', 'Ready... Aim... Fire!BOOOOM!! ...no, wait... cha-CHIK!', '2014-10-06 00:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269988, 1130742, 13077, '<td valign="top">Looks like it was a lovely morning for sure. From the look and size of this I''m guessing it was with an older or basic phone, so well done making a good photo with it.<br/>The only critique I have is that lightpost, but it almost looks like a question mark so that sort of adds some mystery if we are to ''read'' into it.</td>', 'Looks like it was a lovely morning for sure. From the look and size of this I''m guessing it was with an older or basic phone, so well done making a good photo with it.The only critique I have is that lightpost, but it almost looks like a question mark so that sort of adds some mystery if we are to ''read'' into it.', '2014-10-06 00:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269991, 1131178, 13077, '<td valign="top">So much to find, so little time!<br/>I like this.</td>', 'So much to find, so little time!I like this.', '2014-10-06 00:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269992, 1131109, 13077, '<td valign="top">Hurry, there''s cheese!</td>', 'Hurry, there''s cheese!', '2014-10-06 00:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269994, 1130921, 13077, '<td valign="top">LOL - cute, nice find.</td>', 'LOL - cute, nice find.', '2014-10-06 00:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269995, 1130906, 13077, '<td valign="top">Excellent pose by the bird, captured here. I like the B&amp;W treatment, but not sure I would have included so much sky.</td>', 'Excellent pose by the bird, captured here. I like the B&W treatment, but not sure I would have included so much sky.', '2014-10-06 00:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269997, 1130768, 13077, '<td valign="top">A horizontal photo would have worked a lot better for this scene.</td>', 'A horizontal photo would have worked a lot better for this scene.', '2014-10-06 00:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269999, 1130667, 13077, '<td valign="top">What an interesting scene. Depressing but scenic at the same time, and very well photographed.</td>', 'What an interesting scene. Depressing but scenic at the same time, and very well photographed.', '2014-10-06 00:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270001, 1131041, 13077, '<td valign="top">Awww. Congrats if that''s your baby.</td>', 'Awww. Congrats if that''s your baby.', '2014-10-06 00:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270002, 1131174, 13077, '<td valign="top">Excellent scene and sky, but I wonder what 2/3rds sand and 1/3rd sky would have looked like?</td>', 'Excellent scene and sky, but I wonder what 2/3rds sand and 1/3rd sky would have looked like?', '2014-10-06 00:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270003, 1130644, 13077, '<td valign="top">Fly away!</td>', 'Fly away!', '2014-10-06 00:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270005, 1131167, 13077, '<td valign="top">What a cool structure! Nicely composed with the silhouetted tree to give some scale, and good amount of negative space to give it room to breathe.</td>', 'What a cool structure! Nicely composed with the silhouetted tree to give some scale, and good amount of negative space to give it room to breathe.', '2014-10-06 00:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270006, 1130729, 13077, '<td valign="top">The subject being centered might have worked if there was something supporting the scene better on the left, but the lady with her back turned should have been left out of the shot in my opinion.</td>', 'The subject being centered might have worked if there was something supporting the scene better on the left, but the lady with her back turned should have been left out of the shot in my opinion.', '2014-10-06 00:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270009, 1131071, 13077, '<td valign="top">Might be my monitor, but it looks underexposed - the detail in the foreground could probably have been brought up a bit after the fact though.<br/>Not too crazy about the composition either.</td>', 'Might be my monitor, but it looks underexposed - the detail in the foreground could probably have been brought up a bit after the fact though.Not too crazy about the composition either.', '2014-10-06 00:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270010, 1131119, 13077, '<td valign="top">Clever use of an old boot.<br/>I think some artistic license and moving the ''planter'' to compose for a cleaner looking background would have improved this a lot, though.</td>', 'Clever use of an old boot.I think some artistic license and moving the ''planter'' to compose for a cleaner looking background would have improved this a lot, though.', '2014-10-06 00:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270011, 1131092, 13077, '<td valign="top">Heh, clever title. Does the plant belong to a guy named Robert too?</td>', 'Heh, clever title. Does the plant belong to a guy named Robert too?', '2014-10-06 00:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270012, 1130912, 13077, '<td valign="top">You are where you''ve been?</td>', 'You are where you''ve been?', '2014-10-06 00:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270013, 1130872, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nice job getting some sharpness down there - I''m sure not much light makes it through the water so using a phone must make it especially tough to get a sharp photo.</td>', 'Nice job getting some sharpness down there - I''m sure not much light makes it through the water so using a phone must make it especially tough to get a sharp photo.', '2014-10-06 00:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270015, 1130764, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very nice, gives the feeling that it''s part of a barren urban landscape, leaving the story of why there are no people up to the viewer. I like the near symmetry of it as well.</td>', 'Very nice, gives the feeling that it''s part of a barren urban landscape, leaving the story of why there are no people up to the viewer. I like the near symmetry of it as well.', '2014-10-06 00:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270016, 1130908, 13077, '<td valign="top">Such a colorful, visually exciting scene. I like it a lot.</td>', 'Such a colorful, visually exciting scene. I like it a lot.', '2014-10-06 00:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270018, 1131022, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nice layered slice of life here, I like how everyone is doing their own thing.</td>', 'Nice layered slice of life here, I like how everyone is doing their own thing.', '2014-10-06 00:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270054, 1131092, 61396, '<td valign="top">it looks alive</td>', 'it looks alive', '2014-10-06 01:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270055, 1131034, 61396, '<td valign="top">+1 for the fingers of the person besides you giving this some context</td>', '+1 for the fingers of the person besides you giving this some context', '2014-10-06 01:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270195, 1131152, 20056, '<td valign="top">Inspiring, clever!</td>', 'Inspiring, clever!', '2014-10-06 11:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270197, 1131069, 20056, '<td valign="top">I love it!</td>', 'I love it!', '2014-10-06 11:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270198, 1131014, 20056, '<td valign="top">Gorgeus!, maybe a little too much noise cleaning?</td>', 'Gorgeus!, maybe a little too much noise cleaning?', '2014-10-06 11:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270236, 1130632, 177107, '<td valign="top">oooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooh</td>', 'oooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooh', '2014-10-06 12:37:51.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(7270285, 1130712, 13077, '<td valign="top">Good composition and detail, but the processing looks like it was trying to increase the sharpness but I don''t much like the look it ended up with.<br/>Still, the photo itself is strong enough to overcome that.</td>', 'Good composition and detail, but the processing looks like it was trying to increase the sharpness but I don''t much like the look it ended up with.Still, the photo itself is strong enough to overcome that.', '2014-10-06 15:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270289, 1130784, 13077, '<td valign="top">This is interesting - if I let my eyes go crossed while staring at it, it starts to become a horizon and I feel like it''ll come into focus any second, or something will come over that ridge on this alien landscape.</td>', 'This is interesting - if I let my eyes go crossed while staring at it, it starts to become a horizon and I feel like it''ll come into focus any second, or something will come over that ridge on this alien landscape.', '2014-10-06 15:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270290, 1131182, 13077, '<td valign="top">That''s excellent - I couldn''t match that with a regular camera let alone a phone. It''s all in the lighting and you did a great job with that.</td>', 'That''s excellent - I couldn''t match that with a regular camera let alone a phone. It''s all in the lighting and you did a great job with that.', '2014-10-06 15:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270291, 1130671, 13077, '<td valign="top">Is that what the flower''s called? I can''t really see the resemblance</td>', 'Is that what the flower''s called? I can''t really see the resemblance', '2014-10-06 15:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270296, 1130676, 13077, '<td valign="top">It''s interesting and nicely layered, and I know it was dark so the motion blur is to be expected.</td>', 'It''s interesting and nicely layered, and I know it was dark so the motion blur is to be expected.', '2014-10-06 15:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270323, 1131204, 13077, '<td valign="top">Well composed, good contrasty light, if maybe a little too contrasty processing but that might have been unavoidable.</td>', 'Well composed, good contrasty light, if maybe a little too contrasty processing but that might have been unavoidable.', '2014-10-06 16:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270325, 1131036, 13077, '<td valign="top">My eye goes right to that spot in the bottom left where the sun is shining through - I would have recommended croping that out.</td>', 'My eye goes right to that spot in the bottom left where the sun is shining through - I would have recommended croping that out.', '2014-10-06 17:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270328, 1130744, 13077, '<td valign="top">This is really cool. Old looking photos of new things are always a good combination.</td>', 'This is really cool. Old looking photos of new things are always a good combination.', '2014-10-06 17:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270330, 1130943, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like this scene. It has composed itself well, and you''ve captured it well too.</td>', 'I like this scene. It has composed itself well, and you''ve captured it well too.', '2014-10-06 17:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270331, 1130793, 13077, '<td valign="top">Excellent pose and well timed. The low-quality look and B&amp;W make it feel like an old safari photo.</td>', 'Excellent pose and well timed. The low-quality look and B&W make it feel like an old safari photo.', '2014-10-06 17:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270332, 1130665, 13077, '<td valign="top">Fascinating tree. Good composition and well exposed for the shadows without blowing out highlights too badly.</td>', 'Fascinating tree. Good composition and well exposed for the shadows without blowing out highlights too badly.', '2014-10-06 17:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270333, 1131046, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very well done composing the web vs. the still-in-focus background, and good tones.</td>', 'Very well done composing the web vs. the still-in-focus background, and good tones.', '2014-10-06 17:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270335, 1130905, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like this. Never seen things like what''s on the plate - are they some kind of fruit pod? Very colorful and attractive.</td>', 'I like this. Never seen things like what''s on the plate - are they some kind of fruit pod? Very colorful and attractive.', '2014-10-06 17:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270339, 1131124, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot. Well composed and the clouds above the wheel look good.</td>', 'I like this a lot. Well composed and the clouds above the wheel look good.', '2014-10-06 17:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270340, 1131032, 13077, '<td valign="top">Interesting how the two guys'' feet positions are exact mirrors of each other.<br/>Not sure I would have left all that blank blue sky up top, a crop or better yet recomposed to show more of the reflections in the wet sand might have looked a bit better.</td>', 'Interesting how the two guys'' feet positions are exact mirrors of each other.Not sure I would have left all that blank blue sky up top, a crop or better yet recomposed to show more of the reflections in the wet sand might have looked a bit better.', '2014-10-06 17:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270341, 1131001, 13077, '<td valign="top">LOL. nice one</td>', 'LOL. nice one', '2014-10-06 17:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270342, 1130632, 13077, '<td valign="top">I''d probably sprain something trying to do that. lol</td>', 'I''d probably sprain something trying to do that. lol', '2014-10-06 17:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270343, 1130634, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like this arrangement of leaves, showing just enough bare ground.</td>', 'I like this arrangement of leaves, showing just enough bare ground.', '2014-10-06 17:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270344, 1131181, 13077, '<td valign="top">Yep, the thumbnails do look a bit small.</td>', 'Yep, the thumbnails do look a bit small.', '2014-10-06 17:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270380, 1131033, 13077, '<td valign="top">I don''t really care for this. I mean, the colors are pretty bold but it all relies on what appears to be existing artwork and in taking the photo nothing seems to have been contributed to it.</td>', 'I don''t really care for this. I mean, the colors are pretty bold but it all relies on what appears to be existing artwork and in taking the photo nothing seems to have been contributed to it.', '2014-10-06 19:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270382, 1131014, 13077, '<td valign="top">Awesome scene, very well done.</td>', 'Awesome scene, very well done.', '2014-10-06 19:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270383, 1130627, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very nice - well composed and excellent dynamic range considering it''s from a phone camera.</td>', 'Very nice - well composed and excellent dynamic range considering it''s from a phone camera.', '2014-10-06 19:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270384, 1130506, 13077, '<td valign="top">The streetlight and tall tree on the left are a bit distracting, I probably would have cropped them out.</td>', 'The streetlight and tall tree on the left are a bit distracting, I probably would have cropped them out.', '2014-10-06 19:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270385, 1131076, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like the composition a lot, as well as the sort of pastel colors in the foreground vs. the bold colors in the canopies along the riverwalk there. The processing looks good, too.</td>', 'I like the composition a lot, as well as the sort of pastel colors in the foreground vs. the bold colors in the canopies along the riverwalk there. The processing looks good, too.', '2014-10-06 19:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270386, 1130709, 13077, '<td valign="top">Excellent detail and good colors.</td>', 'Excellent detail and good colors.', '2014-10-06 19:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270391, 1131172, 13077, '<td valign="top">This would be a good newspaper photo.</td>', 'This would be a good newspaper photo.', '2014-10-06 19:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270392, 1131019, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I like how they''re posed, shoulder to shoulder and staring you down.</td>', 'Very nice. I like how they''re posed, shoulder to shoulder and staring you down.', '2014-10-06 19:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270393, 1130915, 13077, '<td valign="top">I wish the focus here was on the caterpillar.</td>', 'I wish the focus here was on the caterpillar.', '2014-10-06 19:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270394, 1130919, 13077, '<td valign="top">Talk to the hand(s)!</td>', 'Talk to the hand(s)!', '2014-10-06 19:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270395, 1131013, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very nice - crisp and contrasty, good colors and good composition too.</td>', 'Very nice - crisp and contrasty, good colors and good composition too.', '2014-10-06 19:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270396, 1130734, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very cool. Not quite sure what I''m looking at but I like it.</td>', 'Very cool. Not quite sure what I''m looking at but I like it.', '2014-10-06 19:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270397, 1130691, 13077, '<td valign="top">lol</td>', 'lol', '2014-10-06 19:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270399, 1131105, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the black border, even though I''m not normally a fan of borders here.</td>', 'I like the colors and the black border, even though I''m not normally a fan of borders here.', '2014-10-06 19:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270400, 1131111, 13077, '<td valign="top">move over rover!<br/>I like it a lot.</td>', 'move over rover!I like it a lot.', '2014-10-06 19:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270422, 1130689, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very cool. I like it a lot.</td>', 'Very cool. I like it a lot.', '2014-10-06 22:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270423, 1130732, 13077, '<td valign="top">Beautiful landscape.</td>', 'Beautiful landscape.', '2014-10-06 22:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270424, 1130898, 13077, '<td valign="top">Yum. Looks very appetizing, well composed and that tablecloth looks great as a backdrop.</td>', 'Yum. Looks very appetizing, well composed and that tablecloth looks great as a backdrop.', '2014-10-06 22:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270425, 1131051, 13077, '<td valign="top">Looks like some motion blur here - if there was some way to adjust the exposure down a bit it should have helped with that and also maintained more detail in the white parts of the roses.</td>', 'Looks like some motion blur here - if there was some way to adjust the exposure down a bit it should have helped with that and also maintained more detail in the white parts of the roses.', '2014-10-06 22:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270426, 1131117, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured interaction between this gang of gulls - I like how the aggressive one is front and center, he seems to have his two henchmen flanking him as he chews out the one in the foreground, and one''s on lookout.</td>', 'Nicely captured interaction between this gang of gulls - I like how the aggressive one is front and center, he seems to have his two henchmen flanking him as he chews out the one in the foreground, and one''s on lookout.', '2014-10-06 22:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270427, 1131116, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like this composition a lot, actually. Very striking, and not just the rain striking the puddle ;)</td>', 'I like this composition a lot, actually. Very striking, and not just the rain striking the puddle ;)', '2014-10-06 22:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270428, 1131158, 13077, '<td valign="top">Excellent light and exposure, great composition and processing - all in all very well done, one of my favorites of the challenge so far.<br/>This is a great example of when a photo can be more than the sum of its parts, and bring them all together to create art.<br/>I would definitely print and frame this if I were you.</td>', 'Excellent light and exposure, great composition and processing - all in all very well done, one of my favorites of the challenge so far.This is a great example of when a photo can be more than the sum of its parts, and bring them all together to create art.I would definitely print and frame this if I were you.', '2014-10-06 22:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270429, 1130583, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very nice sunrise for sure. I''m not crazy about the branches protruding into the frame from the top left, though.</td>', 'Very nice sunrise for sure. I''m not crazy about the branches protruding into the frame from the top left, though.', '2014-10-06 22:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270437, 1130924, 13077, '<td valign="top">Good colors and pretty good composition, but I wish the focus was on the leaf in the foreground, not the middle ground.</td>', 'Good colors and pretty good composition, but I wish the focus was on the leaf in the foreground, not the middle ground.', '2014-10-06 23:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270439, 1130757, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very well composed, and attractive tones. Really leads the eye in well.</td>', 'Very well composed, and attractive tones. Really leads the eye in well.', '2014-10-06 23:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270440, 1131098, 13077, '<td valign="top">That looks pretty scary but maybe fun, I''ve always been too cheap to try riding one of those...<br/>Nice photo though, simple composition and sharp with punchy colors.</td>', 'That looks pretty scary but maybe fun, I''ve always been too cheap to try riding one of those...Nice photo though, simple composition and sharp with punchy colors.', '2014-10-06 23:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270441, 1130781, 13077, '<td valign="top">I probably would have plucked that grass that''s between the camera and the mushroom here.</td>', 'I probably would have plucked that grass that''s between the camera and the mushroom here.', '2014-10-06 23:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270442, 1130633, 13077, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of driving into the sun, just knowing some fool might blow a stop sign and I wouldn''t see him and crash into him...</td>', 'Reminds me of driving into the sun, just knowing some fool might blow a stop sign and I wouldn''t see him and crash into him...', '2014-10-06 23:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270444, 1131086, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like it - good find, manmade things being reclaimed by nature. Good processing too.</td>', 'I like it - good find, manmade things being reclaimed by nature. Good processing too.', '2014-10-06 23:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270445, 1131010, 13077, '<td valign="top">This works very well. I like it.</td>', 'This works very well. I like it.', '2014-10-06 23:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270446, 1130984, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very lo-fi but the funkiness is somehow pleasing to the eye.</td>', 'Very lo-fi but the funkiness is somehow pleasing to the eye.', '2014-10-06 23:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270447, 1131152, 13077, '<td valign="top">This is great - good use of the very deep DOF of phone cameras here. I think it would still work without the extreme processing, though.</td>', 'This is great - good use of the very deep DOF of phone cameras here. I think it would still work without the extreme processing, though.', '2014-10-06 23:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270448, 1130684, 13077, '<td valign="top">Not a huge fan of the processing on this one.</td>', 'Not a huge fan of the processing on this one.', '2014-10-06 23:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270449, 1130752, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like it a lot. Excellent light play on the textured walls, and the processing really brings out the imperfection and makes everything very interesting.</td>', 'I like it a lot. Excellent light play on the textured walls, and the processing really brings out the imperfection and makes everything very interesting.', '2014-10-06 23:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
