(7270451, 1130953, 13077, '<td valign="top">Looks like a nice scene, but the lighting was pretty harsh and the processing seems to have made it even harsher.</td>', 'Looks like a nice scene, but the lighting was pretty harsh and the processing seems to have made it even harsher.', '2014-10-06 23:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
