(7271193, 1131121, 24073, '<td valign="top">shocked that this did not score a top 10, I had you at a solid 9, I admit I''m a big landscape fan, but some of the ones that finished higher I had at a 6...what?</td>', 'shocked that this did not score a top 10, I had you at a solid 9, I admit I''m a big landscape fan, but some of the ones that finished higher I had at a 6...what?', '2014-10-08 08:20:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(7271197, 1131121, 24073, '<td valign="top">I love the way the sky is contrasted by the Mountains, what mountain is this anyway?  I also love the balance that you achieved with the rows of corn, very pleasing to the eye.  The top left of the mountains grows dark, but not distracting, and doesn''t bother me a bit...love it.  Country living, that is what I''m about, and you did a great job of capturing that setting.  Very inspiring.  thank you.<br/></td>', 'I love the way the sky is contrasted by the Mountains, what mountain is this anyway?  I also love the balance that you achieved with the rows of corn, very pleasing to the eye.  The top left of the mountains grows dark, but not distracting, and doesn''t bother me a bit...love it.  Country living, that is what I''m about, and you did a great job of capturing that setting.  Very inspiring.  thank you.', '2014-10-08 08:25:03.000000', NULL, 0),
